- **Merck Veterinary Manual:** [Periodontal Disease in Small Animals](<https://www.merckvetmanual.com/digestive-system/dentistry-in-small-animals/periodontal-disease-in-small-animals>) — signos clínicos, factores de riesgo y progresión de la enfermedad periodontal.
- **Cornell University College of Veterinary Medicine:** [Periodontal disease](<https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/riney-canine-health-center/health-topics/canine-health-information/periodontal-disease>) — prevalencia, prevención y manejo de la enfermedad periodontal en perros.
